","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"173","text":"Evitar nitroprusiato (toxicidad acumulada IRC común)","guid":"4esAFlUNRa6UnnRrm5ccAw","children":[]},{"id":"177","parent":"173","text":"Vigilar caídas y deterioro cognitivo","guid":"qa2KnLjCRs-dAtAUIMJ91g","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"173","text":"Descartar pseudocrisis (dolor, retención urinaria, infección)","guid":"agLubuH3R6210pI1avRRWg","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"173","text":"Adherencia y polifarmacia → causa frecuente","guid":"ATOHTzAGSNGqm1iXwrjImg","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"173","text":"Considerar HTA secundaria nueva si cambio reciente","guid":"ZIyHNJGnRfi5Z7W9c2wylQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"181","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"ob__nJgJQY-ML67DXDGXnQ","children":[{"id":"182","parent":"181","text":"LA URGENCIA HIPERTENSIVA NO REQUIERE BAJAR PA AGRESIVAMENTE — REDUCCIÓN BRUSCA = ISQUEMIA CEREBRAL Y CORONARIA EN AM CON CURVA AUTORREGULACIÓN DESPLAZADA","guid":"RgCPUQ-QT-eDi-VbiDx3QA","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"181","text":"EMERGENCIA HIPERTENSIVA = PA ALTA + DAÑO ÓRGANO BLANCO AGUDO — EL UMBRAL NUMÉRICO (180/120) ES SECUNDARIO AL DAÑO","guid":"dm2D-0bpQN2BmW6kICznjQ","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"181","text":"BAJAR PAM SOLO 20-25% EN PRIMERA HORA EN EMERGENCIA — NO NORMALIZAR DE GOLPE (RIESGO ACV WATERSHED Y NEFROPATÍA ISQUÉMICA)","guid":"SJzZr-MPTQK3zrMDzuuAVA","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"181","text":"DISECCIÓN AÓRTICA REQUIERE PAS <120 Y FC <60 EN 20 MIN — BETABLOQUEO PRIMERO (FC) ANTES QUE VASODILATADOR (EVITAR TAQUICARDIA REFLEJA)","guid":"ohWfhBatTH-IiKRlLuEHLg","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"181","text":"ACV HEMORRÁGICO INTERACT2/ATACH-2: PAS <140 EN PRIMERAS 6 H REDUCE EXPANSIÓN HEMATOMA SIN AUMENTAR EVENTOS ADVERSOS","guid":"Sk74o8ekQGmjHWQn6npWXw","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"181","text":"ACV ISQUÉMICO REQUIERE HIPERTENSIÓN PERMISIVA SI <220/120 SIN TROMBÓLISIS — BAJAR PRECOZ EMPEORA INFARTO POR HIPOPERFUSIÓN PENUMBRA","guid":"kXuptDYGRvqd1pc8svZ-nA","children":[]},{"id":"188","parent":"181","text":"COCAÍNA: NUNCA BETABLOQUEADORES NO SELECTIVOS (PARADOJA ALFA) — BENZODIACEPINAS + FENTOLAMINA O NITROGLICERINA","guid":"4MQkAQm6RBaQf7rpjwFlKg","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"181","text":"FEOCROMOCITOMA: ALFABLOQUEO ANTES DE BETABLOQUEO — INVERTIR EL ORDEN PRECIPITA CRISIS HIPERTENSIVA POR ALFA NO OPUESTA","guid":"sONFHK9qQqaqmuRNLExfUw","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"181","text":"NICARDIPINA Y CLEVIDIPINA HAN DESPLAZADO A NITROPRUSIATO COMO PRIMERA LÍNEA — MENOR TOXICIDAD CIANURO Y CONTROL MÁS PREDECIBLE","guid":"rp21dSkRQuyEw7S4UPyYBQ","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"181","text":"SOSPECHAR PSEUDOCRISIS EN AM: DOLOR, RETENCIÓN URINARIA, ABSTINENCIA, ANSIEDAD — TRATAR CAUSA NO PA","guid":"OzRq6Ev3Q6GqATxg6JOJ_w","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"181","text":"Referencias","guid":"fif-w91gSmu27oJZa_E5fQ","children":[{"id":"193","parent":"192","text":"McEvoy JW et al. 2024 ESC Guidelines for the Management of Elevated Blood Pressure and Hypertension. Eur Heart J. 2024;45(38):3912-4018.","guid":"PZiOV6u8Qjua654NC-sCKQ","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"192","text":"Whelton PK et al. 2017 ACC/AHA Guideline for the Prevention, Detection, Evaluation, and Management of High Blood Pressure in Adults. J Am Coll Cardiol. 2018;71(19):e127-e248.","guid":"VxbP9pRNRDih8F1b0_-hKQ","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"192","text":"Anderson CS et al. Rapid Blood-Pressure Lowering in Patients with Acute Intracerebral Hemorrhage (INTERACT2). N Engl J Med. 2013;368(25):2355-2365.","guid":"mp5LM9haQ06-ewN_zMwt4w","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"192","text":"Qureshi AI et al. Intensive Blood-Pressure Lowering in Patients with Acute Cerebral Hemorrhage (ATACH-2). N Engl J Med. 2016;375(11):1033-1043.","guid":"-giJrALQRuek-MasxvkVgQ","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"192","text":"Powers WJ et al. Guidelines for the Early Management of Patients with Acute Ischemic Stroke. Stroke. 